TCAudio is a module ("sup") for fpSup Loader v4 by bei (ijigen), and is built
against its headers and build tools. It is a separate project: it is not part
of fpSup and is not endorsed by its author.

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by SIGMA
Corporation. "SIGMA" and "fp" are trade names of SIGMA Corporation. No firmware
image is included. Memory addresses and register values in this repository are
factual observations of firmware Ver.5.02. The built module carries about 6 KB
of menu records taken from the stock page to add its two rows, the same
technique used by other fpSup modules.

menu/ derives from build scripts in fpSup by bei (GPL-3.0).

Use it at your own risk: it modifies the running firmware in the camera's RAM.
There is no warranty.
